WEBVTT

00:00:07.698 --> 00:00:09.552
Inner peace.
心静

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.816
Inner peace.
心静

00:00:15.689 --> 00:00:17.517
Inner...
心…静

00:00:18.953 --> 00:00:21.085
Inner peace.
心…静

00:00:23.827 --> 00:00:28.528
Would whoever is making
that flapping sound quiet down?!
出怪声的家伙给我安静！

00:00:31.618 --> 00:00:32.706
Inner...
心静

00:00:32.836 --> 00:00:35.709
- [squawks]
- Hmm...

00:00:37.406 --> 00:00:39.451
Oh, Zeng.
原来是小张

00:00:39.582 --> 00:00:41.192
Excellent.
来得正好

00:00:41.323 --> 00:00:43.368
I could use some
good news right now.
你是来通报好消息的吧

00:00:46.415 --> 00:00:47.982
Uhhh...

00:00:50.811 --> 00:00:52.900
- Master! Master!
- Hmm?
大师！大师！

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:57.208
I have... It's...
It's very bad news.
我有…嗯…很坏的消息

00:00:57.339 --> 00:00:59.689
Ahh, Shifu.
师傅

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:03.127
There is just news.
There is no good or bad.
消息就是消息
没有所谓的好或坏

00:01:03.258 --> 00:01:06.740
Master, your vision.
Your vision was right.
大师 你的预言成真了

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:10.570
Tai Lung has broken out of
prison. He's on his way.
残豹逃狱了 他杀过来了

00:01:11.788 --> 00:01:14.617
That is bad news...
这真的是坏消息…

00:01:14.748 --> 00:01:18.447
...if you do not believe that
the Dragon Warrior can stop him.
…如果你不信神龙大侠能阻止他

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:23.191
The panda? Master, that panda
is not the Dragon Warrior.
那只熊猫？
大师 他不是神龙大侠啦

00:01:23.321 --> 00:01:26.716
He wasn't meant to be here!
It was an accident.
他根本没那个料 那只是意外

00:01:26.847 --> 00:01:28.979
There are no accidents.
世上没有意外

00:01:29.110 --> 00:01:33.201
[sighing heavily] Yes, I know.
You've said that already.
我知道 你说过两次了

00:01:33.331 --> 00:01:37.640
- Twice.
- Well, that was
no accident, either.
那也不是意外

00:01:37.771 --> 00:01:38.902
Thrice.
这是第三次

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:40.600
My old friend,
我的老友…

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:45.256
the panda will never fulfill
his destiny, nor you yours,
…熊猫和你永远也不会达成使命

00:01:45.387 --> 00:01:48.782
until you let go
of the illusion of control.
除非你能抛开心中的成见

00:01:48.912 --> 00:01:50.348
Illusion?
成见？

00:01:50.479 --> 00:01:53.395
Yes. Look at
this tree, Shifu.
没错 看看那棵树

00:01:53.525 --> 00:01:56.441
I cannot make it blossom
when it suits me,
我不能逼它开花

00:01:56.572 --> 00:01:59.749
nor make it bear fruit
before its time.
也不能逼它结果

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:03.231
But there are things
we can control.
不过有些事我能掌控

00:02:03.361 --> 00:02:05.494
I can control
when the fruit will fall.
我能让果子提早掉下来

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.539
- [grunts]
- [chuckles]
我能让果子提早掉下来

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:09.585
And I can control...
我也能决定…

00:02:10.586 --> 00:02:12.936
...where to plant the seed.
…在哪里种树

00:02:13.067 --> 00:02:15.243
That is no illusion, Master.
这不是成见 大师

00:02:16.723 --> 00:02:18.725
Ah, yes.
没错

00:02:18.855 --> 00:02:21.205
But no matter what you do
但是不管你怎么做

00:02:21.336 --> 00:02:24.165
that seed will grow
to be a peach tree.
那粒种子还是会长成桃树

00:02:24.295 --> 00:02:26.733
You may wish for
an apple or an orange,
你也许想要它长出苹果或橘子
不过你只会吃到桃子

00:02:26.863 --> 00:02:28.952
but you will get a peach.
你也许想要它长出苹果或橘子
不过你只会吃到桃子

00:02:29.083 --> 00:02:32.782
But a peach cannot
defeat Tai Lung!
但是一颗桃子不能打败残豹

00:02:32.913 --> 00:02:35.567
Maybe it can.
搞不好可以

00:02:35.698 --> 00:02:38.396
If you are willing to guide it.
只要你愿意引导它

00:02:38.527 --> 00:02:40.355
To nurture it.
栽培它

00:02:40.485 --> 00:02:41.748
To believe in it.
相信它

00:02:41.878 --> 00:02:44.272
But how? How?
我该怎么做？

00:02:44.402 --> 00:02:46.448
I need your help, Master.
我需要你的帮忙

00:02:46.578 --> 00:02:50.757
No, you just need to believe.
不 你只要有信心就行

00:02:50.887 --> 00:02:53.629
Promise me, Shifu.
答应我

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:56.371
Promise me you will believe.
答应我你要有信心

00:02:56.501 --> 00:03:00.288
I will try.
我会努力

00:03:00.941 --> 00:03:02.638
Good.
很好

00:03:04.553 --> 00:03:06.816
My time has come.
我的时辰到了

00:03:08.905 --> 00:03:13.214
You must continue
your journey without me.
你必须自己完成这项使命

00:03:13.344 --> 00:03:15.999
What are you...? Wait!
你说什么…？

00:03:17.174 --> 00:03:19.133
Master!
大师！

00:03:19.263 --> 00:03:21.004
You can't leave me!
你不能丢下我！

00:03:24.573 --> 00:03:27.445
You must believe.
你一定要有信心

00:03:28.229 --> 00:03:29.970
Master!
大师！

